WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.317
Roar! Eddy's engine started.

2
00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:14.007
His tires spun.

3
00:00:14.008 --> 00:00:16.500
And he took off!

4
00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:20.836
Vroom! Eddy zoomed across the parking lot.

5
00:00:20.837 --> 00:00:27.168
"Go, Eddy!" Poppy cheered.

6
00:00:27.169 --> 00:00:38.429
"Woo-hoo!"

7
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:42.136
"Eddy looks fast today!" said Jeb.

8
00:00:42.137 --> 00:00:46.947
"Yes!" said Dipper.

9
00:00:46.948 --> 00:00:49.924
Mr. Grill came outside.

10
00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:53.384
"Time for class!" he said.

11
00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:56.715
Eddy drove over.

12
00:00:56.716 --> 00:01:00.083
Everyone parked near the teacher.

13
00:01:00.084 --> 00:01:04.089
"Good morning, Mr. Grill," they said.

14
00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:07.460
"What's the plan today?" asked Dipper.

15
00:01:07.461 --> 00:01:13.094
"Is there a field trip?"

16
00:01:13.095 --> 00:01:17.759
"No," said Mr. Grill.

17
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:26.180
"Will we go fast?" asked Zippy.

18
00:01:26.181 --> 00:01:31.820
"No," said Mr. Grill.

19
00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:37.131
"What will we do?" asked Poppy.

20
00:01:37.132 --> 00:01:39.927
Mr. Grill smiled.

21
00:01:39.928 --> 00:01:43.223
"We will stop," he said.

22
00:01:43.224 --> 00:01:46.126
"Stop?" cried Zippy.

23
00:01:46.127 --> 00:01:50.800
"That's right," said Mr. Grill.

24
00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:58.394
"Today we'll use our brakes!"

